# The Social Engineering window (see socialwin.c) made without being shown (init with a negative faction: as the tutorial's tour makes
# it), then shown (the sub interface's mode is set and the main screen's panels fill), hidden and closed: the way the tour drives it. With
# the window up, the functions that answer no event (the sub interface's handlers) and the two that do nothing are called by hand, the
# window's two bubble helpers draw a bubble each (a bubble takes a few seconds to come up, so the snaps wait), and the penalty check is
# asked about the models a project cancels. Every model can be chosen (give_techs_all) and the faction holds the Cloning Vats (as
# socialwin_projects.scene makes it) so that the check says yes.
# Leave time after each step; the snaps take 2 s each.
